    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter into the long-since defunct <strong>Frankie's Funclub!</strong> Where parties used to fill the air with laughter and activity - now, it lies abandoned, and has fallen prey to scavengers, like you! Sneak around in this thrilling thief-simulator finding valuable <i>(and sometimes suspicious)</i>\u00a0LOOT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resell on the black market for <strong>PROFIT, upgrades, and secret unlockable content.</strong> You're not alone, however, and <strong>certain threats</strong> hang around every corner, hungry for attention!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid detection from the wandering residents and security cameras of the FunClub by sneaking, hiding from, and distracting them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect valuable merchandise from the Club's glory days to earn a profit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snag photos of the girls to sell online from your own furnishable hideout!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disguise yourself and walk among the girls to succeed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game achievements for thieves who explore every inch of the FunClub</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen scenes to snatch up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ findable looping VHS tapes~</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to Frankie's FunClub!</i></p>",
